{"name": "create_mail_draft", "args": {"subject": "Re: STAT5301英文进展的提醒", "body": "Dear Professor Zhou,\n\nThank you for your reminder. I have not yet finalised the dataset for my STAT5301 project, so I am still selecting data: I am comparing possible sources and checking which one is suitable for the statistical question I plan to study. My next step is to confirm the data source and its access conditions, the definitions of the key variables and the available sample size, so that I can judge whether the data meet the assumptions of the analysis I have in mind. Once the dataset is fixed, I will report the specific statistical problems I encounter and how I intend to address them. I will update you as soon as the data choice is confirmed.\n\nBest regards,\nXu", "to": "zhou.yan@stat5301.example.invalid", "binding_id": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "reply_to_local_id": "5be993696b9736b836de4a327f114017edafa8e2747c2f9d6b5fb37b488dab18", "attachment_ids": null}, "result": {"kind": "mail_draft", "id": "8b1549aa-034c-5ed8-8c0b-9c76be5560e6", "subject": "Re: STAT5301英文进展的提醒", "body": "Dear Professor Zhou,\n\nThank you for your reminder. I have not yet finalised the dataset for my STAT5301 project, so I am still selecting data: I am comparing possible sources and checking which one is suitable for the statistical question I plan to study. My next step is to confirm the data source and its access conditions, the definitions of the key variables and the available sample size, so that I can judge whether the data meet the assumptions of the analysis I have in mind. Once the dataset is fixed, I will report the specific statistical problems I encounter and how I intend to address them. I will update you as soon as the data choice is confirmed.\n\nBest regards,\nXu", "to": "zhou.yan@stat5301.example.invalid", "bindingId": "9dcfcd09-0e99-4608-acdf-675691717513", "replyToLocalId": "5be993696b9736b836de4a327f114017edafa8e2747c2f9d6b5fb37b488dab18", "attachmentIds": [], "attachments": [], "conversationId": "cb67c78e-c120-4db6-ac21-a33779cbdc06", "createdAt": "2026-11-22T01:20:11.918Z", "status": "draft", "detail": "仅保存可编辑草稿；用户预览确认后才会发送。", "familyId": "8b1549aa-034c-5ed8-8c0b-9c76be5560e6", "revision": 1, "lifecycleStatus": "active", "supersededBy": null, "resolved": false}, "error": false}
